#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: lab591-dev-bridge.php
msgid "Lab591 Dev Bridge"
msgstr "Lab591 Dev Bridge"

#. Description of the plugin
#: lab591-dev-bridge.php
msgid "Secure bridge between a local Claude Code workspace and this site: read-only exploration, controlled deploys with health check and rollback."
msgstr "Ponte sicuro tra un progetto Claude Code in locale e questo sito: esplorazione in sola lettura, deploy controllati con health check e rollback."

#. Author of the plugin
#: lab591-dev-bridge.php
msgid "Lab591"
msgstr "Lab591"

